      "SARAH: Veeeeee! I’m sorry! Didn’t mean to give you a scare.\nVERONICA: Sarah Beee! No! Not at all! Travel has me jumpy, I guess.\nSARAH: You. Look. Gorgeous. What the hell are you doing… other than making us all look less-than?\nVERONICA: My dear, no one’s making you look ANYTHING less than exquisite. Trust.",
